<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Does the rescue shuttle indeed exist?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only one way to find it out. Tighten the straps of your overall to navigate in the gravity-free vacuum \u2013 and go ahead to reveal mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Estimated game duration: 4-7 hours.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341780/extras/c1e00ef5fb33171b4cd031a9246a01e1.poster.avif?t=1771157743\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341780/extras/c1e00ef5fb33171b4cd031a9246a01e1.webm?t=1771157743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Unhexigon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341780/585f792f85e25c3bf683b8f407536e1443fe3a67/header.jpg?t=1771157743","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3341780/201639909/d96b7ac0c16317f5649272c2a827e85a3cd4d8bd/1764784759/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764787075","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3341780/201639909/d96b7ac0c16317f5649272c2a827e85a3cd4d8bd/1764784759/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764787075","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3341780/201639909/d96b7ac0c16317f5649272c2a827e85a3cd4d8bd/1764784759/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764787075","id":257242988,"name":"Final Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257242988/5480394f192a6d304fdf5c4bb1365f37902e2e06/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764787075"},{"dash_a